By 1151, sickness had weakened Gerano from within. Tyran led Renia and Karak to a one-way portal as Zanarak's army breached the city.
Vera: The ritual needs minutes. Keep the passage clear!
Lucilia was killed before it could be completed. Tyran and his guards turned to face Zanarak.
Tyran: Take my daughter through. Do not look back.
